Servings Per Container about 90 about 45"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Calories 2,000 Calories 2,500\nTotal Fat Less than 65g 80g\nSat Fat Less than 20g 25g\nCholesterol Less than 300mg 300mg\nSodium Less than 2,400mg 2,400mg\nPotassium 3,500mg 3,500mg\nTotal Carbohydrate 300g 375g\nDietary Fiber 25g 30g\t\nProtein 50g 65g \nCalories per gram: Fat 9 ~ Carbohydrate 4 ~ Protein 4\n"},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"Contains milk and soy ingredients."},{"type":"Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions","notes":"DIRECTIONS: Add one (1) scoop (25 g) to two (2) scoops (50 g) to 8 - 16 fl. ounces of water or your favorite beverage. Mix in your Precision Engineered shaker or a blender and drink immediately for best results. You can drink Precision Engineered Whey Protein any time during the day to add extra high quality protein to your daily calorie intake. Be sure to figure the extra calories provided by milk, juice or whatever you may add to your Precision Engineered Whey Protein. Increase or decrease the amount of liquid added to achieve desired consistency."},{"type":"Precautions re: Allergies","notes":"Contains milk and soy ingredients."},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"HIGH IN PROTEIN\nHIGH CONCENTRATION OF BRANCHED CHAIN AMINO ACIDS"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Whey is popular with bodybuilders, people on high protein diets, and anyone looking for a quick, easy-to-use nutritional drink."},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"Whey is a natural by-product of milk and is loaded with strength-building protein, which plays a role in optimal nutrition. Whey naturally contains Branched Chain Amino Acids – made up of Leucine, Isoleucine and Valine."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"These nutrients are important components of muscle tissue."},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"Precision Engineered is a high quality, premium whey protein containing a full spectrum glycomacropeptide complex."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"It is superior nourishment designed for those who want only the best in a nutritional drink."},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"Available in three easy-to-mix flavors, Precision Engineered is the perfect complement to your exercise schedule."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"For an extra treat, blend with fruit or your favorite non-fat frozen yogurt."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Precision Engineered has pioneered the manufacture of premium sports nutrition supplements. Our commitment to quality is the highest in our industry. Every product undergoes rigorous analysis for purity, potency, safety and freshness. We guarantee it!"}],"claims":[{"langualCode":"P0065","langualCodeDescription":"Nutrient "},{"langualCode":"P0115","langualCodeDescription":"All Other"}],"events":[{"date":"2016-12-23","type":"Date entered into DSLD"}],"userGroups":[{"dailyValueTargetGroupName":"Adults and children 4 or more years of age","langualCode":"P0250","langualCodeDescription":"Adults and Children 4 years and above"}],"ingredientRows":[{"order":1,"ingredientId":284519,"description":null,"notes":null,"quantity":[{"servingSizeOrder":1,"servingSizeQuantity":50,"operator":"=","quantity":200,"unit":"Calorie(s)","dailyValueTargetGroup":[],"servingSizeUnit":"Gram(s)"},{"servingSizeOrder":1,"servingSizeQuantity":25,"operator":"=","quantity":100,"unit":"Calorie(s)","dailyValueTargetGroup":[],"servingSizeUnit":"Gram(s)"}],"nestedRows":[{"order":2,"ingredientId":284522,"description":null,"notes":null,"quantity":[{"servingSizeOrder":1,"servingSizeQuantity":50,"operator":"=","quantity":40,"unit":"Calorie(s)","dailyValueTargetGroup":[],"servingSizeUnit":"Gram(s)"},{"servingSizeOrder":1,"servingSizeQuantity":25,"operator":"=","quantity":20,"unit":"Calorie(s)","dailyValueTargetGroup":[],"servingSizeUnit":"Gram(s)"}],"nestedR